  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast bias when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) — model tends to overreact.",
    "Adjust downward for forecasts that overshoot recent highs (especially after spikes) — model exhibits momentum bias.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction for persistent over- or under-forecasting — model fails to revert to historical mean.",
    "Lower forecast for early days of new sentiment shifts — model lags in reacting to sentiment changes.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment when price is trending downward — model underweights negative sentiment.",
    "Avoid over-optimistic forecasts when sentiment is neutral or weak — model tends to overestimate upside potential."
  ]
